अ|अं|अः
अ The letter<BR>a. A negative,<BR>in, un,<BR>not. An interjection, O! In<BR>composition अ<BR>a becomes अन्<BR>an before a vowel; as, अन्_आदि.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=001-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=yat" target="_blank">Correction</a>

