क्रमक|क्रमकः
क्रमक (कः) 1.<BR>m. A student who<BR>goes through a regular course<BR>of study.<BR>a. Methodical.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=220-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=yat" target="_blank">Correction</a>

