गम्
गम् (औ-ऌ) गच्छति 1.<BR>a. To go, to<BR>march. With अनु to follow, to<BR>imitate; with अधि to obtain, to<BR>peruse, to omit; with अप to go<BR>away; with अव to know; with आ<BR>to arrive at, (causal) to wait, to de-<BR>lay; with उत् to approach; with<BR>उप to go near, or to; with दुर्<BR>to go with difficulty; with नि to<BR>get wisdom, to take; with निर्<BR>to go forth or out; with परि to<BR>surround; with वि to go against;<BR>with सं (act.) to go to, (mid.) to<BR>accompany, to encounter; with<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=246-b" target="_blank">Page246-b+ 38</a>]<BR>उप and आ to approach; with परि<BR>and उत् to rise from a seat; with<BR>प्रति and आ to return; with प्रति<BR>and उत् to return to go to meet;<BR>with सं and आ to meet; with<BR>सं and उप to yield, to surrender.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=246-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=yat" target="_blank">Correction</a>

