चर्
चर् चरति 1.<BR>a. To go; to eat.<BR>(क) चारयति 10th to doubt, or<BR>not doubt. With अभि to deceive,<BR>conjure, attend; with अनु to<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=279-a" target="_blank">Page279-a+ 38</a>]<BR>follow, imitate; with आ to<BR>practise; with उत् to transgress,<BR>expel, rise; with उप to ap-<BR>proach, worship; with परि to<BR>serve; with प्र to preach, pre-<BR>vail; with वि to judge, discuss;<BR>with सं to ride on; with अति<BR>and आ to transgress; with वि<BR>and अभि to commit whoredom;<BR>with सं and आ to inform, to tell.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=278-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=yat" target="_blank">Correction</a>

