णश् (य) नश्यति 4.<BR>a. To disappear;<BR>to perish, to be annihilated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=318-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=yat" target="_blank">Correction</a>

णस्
णस् (ञ) नसति 1.<BR>c. To be crooked, li-<BR>terally or metaphorically, to bend.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=318-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=yat" target="_blank">Correction</a>

णह्
णह् (ञ, औ) नह्यति, ते 4.<BR>c. To bind<BR>or tie. With सं to put on armour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=318-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=yat" target="_blank">Correction</a>

णास्
णास् (ङ, ऋ) नासते 1.<BR>d. To sound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=318-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=yat" target="_blank">Correction</a>

णिक्ष्
णिक्ष् निक्षति 1.<BR>a. To kiss.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=318-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=yat" target="_blank">Correction</a>

णिज्
णिज् (ल, इ) निंक्ते 2.<BR>d. To cleanse<BR>with; (लि, औ, इर) नेनेक्ति to che-<BR>rish; नेनिक्ते 3.<BR>c. To purify.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=318-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=yat" target="_blank">Correction</a>

णिद्
णिद् (इ) निन्दति 1.<BR>a. To abuse, to<BR>revile. (ऋ) नेदति, ते 1.<BR>c. Idem.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=318-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=yat" target="_blank">Correction</a>

णिल्
णिल् नेलति 1.<BR>a. To misunderstand;<BR>to be thick, impenetrable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=318-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=yat" target="_blank">Correction</a>

णिव्
णिव् (इ) निम्वति 1.<BR>a. To wet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=318-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=yat" target="_blank">Correction</a>

णिश्
णिश् नेशति 1.<BR>a. To meditate pro-<BR>foundly, or abstractedly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=318-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=yat" target="_blank">Correction</a>

णिष्
णिष् नेषति<BR>a. To meditate closely.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=318-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=yat" target="_blank">Correction</a>

णिस्
णिस् (ल, इ-ङ) निंस्ते 2.<BR>d. To kiss.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=318-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=yat" target="_blank">Correction</a>

णी
णी नयति, ते 1.<BR>c. To conduct, lead<BR>to, get. With अनु to intreat, to<BR>assimilate, to favour; with अप<BR>to remove, attract; with अभि<BR>to indicate by signs, be kind to;<BR>with आ to bring; with उत् to<BR>raise up; with उप to approach;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=319-a" target="_blank">Page319-a+ 37</a>]<BR>with दुर् to behave ill; with निर्<BR>to get, to ascertain; with परि to<BR>marry; with प्र to love; with वि<BR>to remove to a distance, be hum-<BR>ble; with सु to be polite; with सं<BR>to collect or assemble; with वि<BR>and अप to disperse; with वि and<BR>निर to decide by law; with सं<BR>and अनु to intreat; with सं and<BR>आ to collect, to assemble.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=318-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=yat" target="_blank">Correction</a>

णील्
णील् नीलति 1.<BR>a. To be blue.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=319-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=yat" target="_blank">Correction</a>

णीव्
णीव् नीवति 1.<BR>a. To be large.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=319-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=yat" target="_blank">Correction</a>

णु
णु (ल) नौति नुवति 2.<BR>a. To praise.<BR>With आ to utter a cry of regret.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=319-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=yat" target="_blank">Correction</a>

णुद्
णुद् (श-औ) नुदति 6.<BR>a. To cast, to<BR>command. With अप to remove;<BR>with निर् to throw out; to con-<BR>fess; with प्र to follow; with वि<BR>to be happy; with सं to drive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=319-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=yat" target="_blank">Correction</a>

णू
णू (श) नुवति 6.<BR>a. To praise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=319-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=yat" target="_blank">Correction</a>

णेद्
णेद् (ऋ) नेदति, ते 1.<BR>c. To censure;<BR>to approach.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=319-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=yat" target="_blank">Correction</a>

णेष्
णेष् (ङ, ऋ) नेषति 1.<BR>d. To go, approach.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=319-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=yat" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त|तं|तः
त<BR>t The sixteenth consonant, first<BR>of the fourth or dental class.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=319-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=yat" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त|तं|तः
त (तः) 1.<BR>m. A thief; nectar; a<BR>barbarian; the hip; the womb;<BR>a tail; a tree; a bad man; a<BR>jewel.<BR>n. Crossing; virtue.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=319-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=yat" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तक्
तक् तकति 1.<BR>a. To laugh at or de-<BR>ride; to bear. With व्यति to re-<BR>tort a laugh. (इ) तङ्कति to live<BR>in distress, or want.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=319-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=yat" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तक
तक (कः-का-कं)<BR>a. Belonging to that.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=319-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=yat" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तकिल|तकिलः
तकिल (लः-ला-लं)<BR>a. Fraudulent,<BR>crafty.<BR>f. A medicament.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=319-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=yat" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तक्य|तक्यः
तक्य (क्यः-क्या-क्यं)<BR>a. Laughable, ri-<BR>diculous; to be borne.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=319-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=yat" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तक्र|तक्रं
तक्र (क्रं) 1.<BR>n. Butter-milk with a<BR>fourth part of water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=319-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=yat" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तक्रकूर्च्चिका|तक्रकूर्चिका
