तक्रमांस|तक्रमांसं
तक्र-मांस (सं) 1.<BR>n. Meat fried with<BR>ghee and eaten with butter-milk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=319-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=yat" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तक्राट|तक्राटः
