तक्ष्
तक्ष् तक्षति 1.<BR>a. To cover; to peel.<BR>(न, ऊ) तक्ष्णोति to pare; with<BR>5.<BR>a. सं To censure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=319-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=yat" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तक्षक|तक्षकः
तक्षक (कः) 1.<BR>m. A principal serpent<BR>of<BR>pātāla; a carpenter; a chief<BR>actor in the prelude of a drama;<BR>a tree;<BR>Vishwakarma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=319-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=yat" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तक्षण|तक्षणं
तक्षण (णं) 1.<BR>n. Paring, peeling.<BR>planing.<BR>f. A carpenter's adze.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=319-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=yat" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तक्षन्
तक्षन् (क्षा) 5.<BR>m. A carpenter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=319-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=yat" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तक्षशिला
तक्ष-शिला (ला) 1.<BR>f. The name of a<BR>city;<BR>Taxila in the<BR>Punjab.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=319-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=yat" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तग्
तग् (इ) तङ्गति 1.<BR>a. To go or move;<BR>to quake; to stumble.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=319-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=yat" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तगर|तगरं|तगरः
तगर (रः) 1.<BR>m. A tree (Tabernæ-<BR>montana coronaria), &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=319-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=yat" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तगरपादिका
तगर-पादिका (का) 1.<BR>f. Idem.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=319-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=yat" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तङ्क|तंक|तंकः|तङ्कः
तङ्क (ङ्कः) 1.<BR>m. An axe; grief; fear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=319-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=yat" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तज्ज
तज्ज (ज्जः-ज्जा-ज्जं)<BR>a. Immediate, in-<BR>stantaneously produced.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=319-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=yat" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तञ्च्|तंच्
तञ्च् (उ) तञ्चति 1.<BR>a. To go with<BR>(ध, ऊ) तनक्ति 7.<BR>a. To contract.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=319-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=yat" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तञ्ज
तञ्ज (ध, ऊ) तनक्ति 1.<BR>a. To straighten,<BR>contract or shrink.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=319-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=yat" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तट्
तट् तटति 1.<BR>a. To be elevated or<BR>high; to rise. (क) ताटयति 10.<BR>a. To beat, to persecute.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=319-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=yat" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तट|तटं|तटः
तट (टः-टा-टी-टं) 1.<BR>m. f. n. A shore<BR>or bank.<BR>n. A field.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=319-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=yat" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तटस्थ|तटस्थं|तटस्थः
तट-स्थ (स्थः-स्था-स्थं)<BR>a. Indifferent,<BR>neutral; on shore.<BR>n. Spirituality.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=320-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=yat" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तटाक|तटाकं|तटाकः
तटा_क (कः) 1.<BR>m. A pond deep<BR>enough for lotuses, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=320-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=yat" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तटिनी
तटिनी (नी) 3.<BR>f. A river.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=320-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=yat" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तड्
तड् (ङ, इ) तण्डते 1.<BR>d. To beat or<BR>strike. (क) ताडयति 10.<BR>a. To<BR>beat, to persecute; to shine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=320-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=yat" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तडग|तडगः
तडग (गः) 1.<BR>m. A pond or pool.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=320-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=yat" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तडाक|तडाकः
तडा_क (कः) 1.<BR>m. A pond. (का)<BR>f.<BR>A bank; a blow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=320-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=yat" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तडाग|तडागं|तडागः
