तडित्
तडित् (त्) 5.<BR>f. Lightning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=320-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=yat" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तडित्वत्|तडित्वन्त्
तडित्वत् (त्वान्-त्वती-त्वत्)<BR>a. Ligh-<BR>tening, shining.<BR>m. A cloud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=320-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=yat" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तडिल्लता
तडि-ल्लता (ता) 1.<BR>f. Forked lightning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=320-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=yat" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तण्डक|तंडक|तंडकः|तण्डकः
