तॄ
तॄ तरति 1.<BR>a. To pass over or across.<BR>With अव to descend from above;<BR>with आ to cross in a boat;<BR>with उत् to pass over or above;<BR>with दुर् to cross with difficul-<BR>ty; with निर् to cross safely;<BR>with प्र to excel, to over-reach;<BR>with वि to relinquish, give away;<BR>with (सं) to swim over.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=340-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=yat" target="_blank">Correction</a>

