धू
धू (न, ञ) धूनोति, नुते 5.<BR>c. To shake<BR>or agitate. So धवति ते 1.<BR>c. धुवति<BR>6.<BR>a. धुनाति नीते 9.<BR>c. धूनयति<BR>धावयति 10.<BR>a. With अव to aban-<BR>don, to know, to perceive; with निर^1<BR>to destroy; to go; with वि^2 to agitate.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Jim Funderburk on 20200322. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/issues/202.<BR>[2] Correction submitted by Jim Funderburk on 20200322. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/issues/202.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=397-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=yat" target="_blank">Correction</a>

