भू
भू भवति 1.<BR>a. irr. To be, to be-<BR>come, to be born. (क) भावयति<BR>10.<BR>a. To mix; think; be clear.<BR>(कि, ञ) भवति, ते; भावयति, ते 1.<BR>10.<BR>c. To obtain. With अधि to<BR>rule over; with अनु^1 to experience, do;<BR>with अभि^2 to overcome, afflict; with उत्^3<BR>to be born, preside over; with परा^4<BR>to be vanquished; with प्र^5 be mani-<BR>fest, be equal to, rule; with प्रति^6 to<BR>be substituted for; with परि^7 to dis-<BR>respect, surround; with वि^8 to see, up-<BR>hold; prove, have power; with सं^9 to<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=558-b" target="_blank">Page558-b+ 38</a>]<BR>be possible, contain, overcome,<BR>collect; with वि^10 and अति to be reci-<BR>procally or mutually.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Jim Funderburk on 20200322. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/issues/202.<BR>[2] Correction submitted by Jim Funderburk on 20200322. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/issues/202.<BR>[3] Correction submitted by Jim Funderburk on 20200322. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/issues/202.<BR>[4] Correction submitted by Jim Funderburk on 20200322. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/issues/202.<BR>[5] Correction submitted by Jim Funderburk on 20200322. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/issues/202.<BR>[6] Correction submitted by Jim Funderburk on 20200322. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/issues/202.<BR>[7] Correction submitted by Jim Funderburk on 20200322. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/issues/202.<BR>[8] Correction submitted by Jim Funderburk on 20200322. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/issues/202.<BR>[9] Correction submitted by Jim Funderburk on 20200322. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/issues/202.<BR>[10] Correction submitted by Jim Funderburk on 20200322. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/issues/202.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=558-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=yat" target="_blank">Correction</a>

