मुच्
मुच् (ऌ, औ, श) मुञ्चति, ते 6.<BR>c. To be<BR>loose or free; to forsake; (क)<BR>मोचयति to let loose; to gladden;<BR>(ङ) मोचते 1.<BR>d. To deceive; (इ, ङ)<BR>मुञ्चते to be proud; wicked; to<BR>speak; to pound; to cheat. With<BR>प्र to give much; with वि^1 to obtain<BR>liberation; to give; to loose.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Jim Funderburk on 20200322. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/issues/202.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=596-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=yat" target="_blank">Correction</a>

