यम् (औ, उ) यच्छति 1.<BR>a. To stop,<BR>cease, end, refrain. (क) यमयति,<BR>यामयति 10.<BR>a. To feed; to res-<BR>train.<BR>Act with ञा to seize, to go<BR>to; with उत्^1 to rise, to endeavour;<BR>with नि^2 to remove, to observe a rite,<BR>to restrain; with सं^3 to associate with;<BR>with वि^4 and आ to exercise.<BR>Depon.<BR>with आ to put forth the hand<BR>or any limb; with उप^5 to marry, agree<BR>to, learn; with सं^6 to heap together.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Jim Funderburk on 20200322. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/issues/202.<BR>[2] Correction submitted by Jim Funderburk on 20200322. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/issues/202.<BR>[3] Correction submitted by Jim Funderburk on 20200322. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/issues/202.<BR>[4] Correction submitted by Jim Funderburk on 20200322. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/issues/202.<BR>[5] Correction submitted by Jim Funderburk on 20200322. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/issues/202.<BR>[6] Correction submitted by Jim Funderburk on 20200322. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/issues/202.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=610-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=yat" target="_blank">Correction</a>

