युज्
युज् (य, ङ, औ) युज्यते 4.<BR>d. To con-<BR>fine the thoughts, to meditate.<BR>(ध, ञ, औ, इर) युनक्ति, युक्ते 7.<BR>c. To<BR>mix, join. (कि) योजति, यति 1. 10.<BR>a. To bind. योजयते 10.<BR>a. To<BR>blame. With अनु to inquire, re-<BR>prove; with अभि^1 to utter, accuse;<BR>with उत्^2 to strive; with उप^3 to seize, to<BR>eat; with नि^4 to appoint, to join; with प्र^5 to<BR>be fit, apply to, lend, strive; with वि^6<BR>to separate, send; with सं^7 to unite;<BR>with वि^8 and with नि^9 to appoint, expend,<BR>send, force; with वि^10 and with प्र^11 to divide;<BR>with सं^12 and आ to think profoundly.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Jim Funderburk on 20200322. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/issues/202.<BR>[2] Correction submitted by Jim Funderburk on 20200322. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/issues/202.<BR>[3] Correction submitted by Jim Funderburk on 20200322. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/issues/202.<BR>[4] Correction submitted by Jim Funderburk on 20200322. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/issues/202.<BR>[5] Correction submitted by Jim Funderburk on 20200322. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/issues/202.<BR>[6] Correction submitted by Jim Funderburk on 20200322. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/issues/202.<BR>[7] Correction submitted by Jim Funderburk on 20200322. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/issues/202.<BR>[8] Correction submitted by Jim Funderburk on 20200322. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/issues/202.<BR>[9] Correction submitted by Jim Funderburk on 20200322. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/issues/202.<BR>[10] Correction submitted by Jim Funderburk on 20200322. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/issues/202.<BR>[11] Correction submitted by Jim Funderburk on 20200322. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/issues/202.<BR>[12] Correction submitted by Jim Funderburk on 20200322. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/issues/202.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=614-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=yat" target="_blank">Correction</a>

