रुध्
रुध् (य, ङ) अनुरुध्यते 4.<BR>d. To desire,<BR>to love; consent to; lament.<BR>(ध, इर, औ, ञि) रुणद्धि, रुंद्धे 7.<BR>c. To<BR>impede, to besiege. With अनु<BR>to favour; with अव^1 to guard; with उप^2 to<BR>blockade; {प्रति and वि to resist;<BR>{सं and नि to shut in.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Jim Funderburk on 20200322. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/issues/202.<BR>[2] Correction submitted by Jim Funderburk on 20200322. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/issues/202.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=633-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=yat" target="_blank">Correction</a>

