वद्
वद् (कि) वदति, ते; वदयति, ते 1. 10.<BR>c. To inform, speak, tell; abide.<BR>With अनु to speak to after; with अप^1<BR>to censure; with अभि^2 to salute. with उप<BR>to explain; with निर्^3 to speak out;<BR>with परि^4 to speak against; with प्रति^5 to<BR>reply; with वि to dispute; with वि and प्र<BR>to wrangle; with सं^6 and प्र to speak<BR>in concert. (ङ, इ) वन्दते 1.<BR>d. To<BR>salute; to praise.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Jim Funderburk on 20200322. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/issues/202.<BR>[2] Correction submitted by Jim Funderburk on 20200322. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/issues/202.<BR>[3] Correction submitted by Jim Funderburk on 20200322. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/issues/202.<BR>[4] Correction submitted by Jim Funderburk on 20200322. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/issues/202.<BR>[5] Correction submitted by Jim Funderburk on 20200322. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/issues/202.<BR>[6] Correction submitted by Jim Funderburk on 20200322. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/issues/202.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=655-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=yat" target="_blank">Correction</a>

