वृत|वृतः
वृत (उ, ङ) वर्त्तते 1.<BR>d. To be, to exist,<BR>to stand. (य) वृत्यते 4.<BR>d. To<BR>choose; serve. (क) वर्त्तयति 10.<BR>a.<BR>To shine; speak. With अति, to<BR>surpass; with अनु, to follow,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=719-a" target="_blank">Page719-a+ 38</a>]<BR>imitate, proceed; with अप, to<BR>turn round; with आङ्, to re-<BR>volve, to do repeatedly; with नि<BR>to make artificially; with नि or<BR>निर, to stop, to complete; with<BR>परि, to surround, exchange, ex-<BR>cel, advance, turn back; with<BR>प्र, to set about; with प्रति and<BR>नि, to depart; with वि, to whirl<BR>round; with वि and नि, to re-<BR>turn; with वि and परि, to con-<BR>sider; with सम and अभि, to leap.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=718-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=yat" target="_blank">Correction</a>

