संज्ञाविषय
संज्ञा-विषय (यः) 1.<BR>m. An epithet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=793-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=yat" target="_blank">Correction</a>

