संज्ञित (तः-ता-तं)<BR>a. Denominated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=793-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=yat" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संज्ञु
संज्ञु (ज्ञुः-ज्ञुः-ज्ञु)<BR>a. Knock-kneed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=793-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=yat" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संय|संयः
सं-य (यः) 1.<BR>m. A skeleton.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=YAT&page=793-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=yat" target="_blank">Correction</a>

